meta {
  name: List Importable Radiology Panels
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-radiology-panels/importable?page=1&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  ~search: Chest Screen
  ~department: Radiology
  ~category: CT
  ~excludeListId: {{branchRadiologyPanelListId}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Import picker source for the branch-admin Radiology Panel List "Add Panels to
  List" dialog ("Available to Add" panel): the active branch's **Radiology Master
  Data** panels, paginated. Business JWT; tenant + active branch from the token.

  Optional `search` (case-insensitive on panelName/panelCode), classification
  filters `department` / `category` (matched by name), and `excludeListId` — when
  given, panels already present in that pricing list (matched via
  `BranchRadiologyPanel.sourceRadiologyPanelId`) are dropped server-side, so the
  "Available to Add" vs "Already in this list" split needs no client-side dedup.

  Rows: `{ id, panelName, panelCode }` (a radiology panel has no modality of its
  own — it groups tests). Shares its `where` with "Import Branch Radiology Panels By
  Filter" so the picker and a "select all" import resolve the identical set. 400
  `ACTIVE_BRANCH_REQUIRED` if the JWT has no active branch.
}
